{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061736/block/singleImage/3256397/wm/01M6G27G33G8J31J1QG00KG61P.jpg?updatedAt=1793688233\"/><figcaption>沙田工業中心A座低層單位連5個車位放售。(利嘉閣提供)</figcaption></figure><p>利嘉閣商業部 / 商舖部及投資部聯席董事陳偉國稱，獲業主委託獨家代理沙田源順圍 5 至 7 號沙田工業中心 A 座低層單位連 5 個車位放售事宜。單位建築面積約 6,079 方呎，意向售價約 2,488 萬元。 陳偉國指，物業地點優越，徒步數分鐘即達港鐵站，加上物業意向價極具競爭力，料將吸引用家及投資者垂青。 即睇工商廈買賣盤 (HOUSE730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:41:30.745690+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.880249+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:38:24.570723+00:00","content_hash":"f8bb74ba1613eb146f1a740fecfcd7356f4ed87e62f3f9d126733d3563ce492e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:41:30.745690+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}